Info:
  ver       firmware version
  board     hardware id
  clock     show clock
Radio / mesh:
  advert            flood advert
  advert.zerohop    0-hop advert
  neighbors         list neighbours
  discover.neighbors  active scan
  neighbor.remove <hex>
  tempradio f bw sf cr mins
  clear stats
MediaMesh (radio2): the antenna button
Settings:
  get <key> / set <key> <val>
  sensor list / get / set
Admin:
  get acl       list clients
  setperm <pubkey> <perms>
